      <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.625;color:rgba(15,15,18,0.78);"><span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--rz-background);">We make it clear who you are.</span> One clear story about what you do and where, on your website and Google Business Profile, so AI matches you to the right questions.</p>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.625;color:rgba(15,15,18,0.78);"><span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--rz-background);">We build continuity.</span> We put the same facts on your listings, directories, other sites, and published press releases. When what AI finds elsewhere matches what you say, it trusts what it knows.</p>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.625;color:rgba(15,15,18,0.78);"><span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--rz-background);">We build the proof.</span> We help you collect reviews and turn your best jobs into case studies, so AI can see you're a good company to hire.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/10;background:var(--rz-card);border:1px solid var(--rz-border);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;">
        <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--rz-muted-foreground);">Video</span>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;">
